### Quick manual tests (VS Code "REST Client" extension, or copy into Postman)
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Create accounts
POST {{base}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Account A" }

###
POST {{base}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Account B" }

### Seed balances (credit)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "account_id": 1, "type": "credit", "amount": 100, "reference_id": "seed-1" }

###
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "account_id": 2, "type": "credit", "amount": 50, "reference_id": "seed-2" }

### Debit
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "account_id": 1, "type": "debit", "amount": 10.5, "reference_id": "pay-1", "description": "coffee" }

### Transfer 30 from A to B  (A: 100 -> 70, B: 50 -> 80 if you skip the debit above)
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from_account_id": 1, "to_account_id": 2, "amount": 30, "reference_id": "tr-1" }

### List accounts
GET {{base}}/accounts?page=1&limit=20

### One account
GET {{base}}/accounts/1

### Transactions of an account (optional type filter)
GET {{base}}/accounts/1/transactions?page=1&limit=20&type=debit

### Error examples
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "account_id": 1, "type": "debit", "amount": 999999, "reference_id": "too-much" }

###
GET {{base}}/accounts/9999

###
GET {{base}}/accounts/1/transactions?page=0
